    <string name="press_body">By default every button reacts immediately to a single press.\n\nWith “press twice” on, buttons that have a double-press assignment wait briefly for a second press, so they react a little later. With “hold” on, buttons that have a hold assignment react when released. All other buttons stay instant.</string>
