    <string name="map_no_name">This button reports no name, only the number %1$d. That is normal for many special buttons.</string>
    <string name="map_press_any">Press a button</string>
    <string name="map_press_any_body">Press the special buttons of your remote one by one, in any order: Netflix, Prime Video, Live TV, Guide, color buttons and so on. After each button, choose what is printed on it.\n\nD-pad, OK, Back, Home and volume are not recorded. If a button opens another app anyway, the app comes back by itself.</string>
